      "kind": "supply_chain",
      "headline": "Optimizely flaw put malicious script on many organisations' sites, Unit 42 says",
      "summary": "Unit 42 says an attacker exploited a flaw in Optimizely's Web Experimentation platform on 16 Nov to inject script into customer accounts. The code swapped crypto wallet addresses, skimmed card details and tried to deliver iPhone exploit kits. Optimizely fixed the flaw and removed the code on 17 Nov.",
